!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! Configure Branch Protection !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
Navigate to the repository → Settings → Branches → Branch Protection.
Create a branch protection rule for main:
Disable push → prevents direct pushes.
Require pull request approvals → at least 1 approval.


!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! Pull Request Workflow !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
Any changes in the repository must be made in a new branch as a pull request. 
Changes must be reviewed and approved before merging into the main branch
